OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785383016
OL,3,CTeenage boy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Cdrug dealer
OL,6,FA teenage boy has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering a drug dealer in Cheltenham
OL,8,Fafter robbing him at knifepoint with
OL,9,Fanother boy.
OL,11,FThe 16-year-old, who cannot be named
OL,12,Ffor legal reasons, stabbed Hamid
OL,13,FErfani, in an alleyway between Larput
OL,14,FPlace and St Paul's Road on 16
OL,15,FDecember 2025 after taking his cash,
OL,16,Fdrugs, and mobile phone off him.
OL,18,FThe teenager was found guilty by a
OL,19,Fjury at Bristol Crown Court on Monday
OL,20,F27 July.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
