PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785383016
OL,3,CTeenage boy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Cdrug dealer
OL,6,FHe had pleaded not guilty to the
OL,7,Fcharge, claiming that he acted in self-
OL,8,Fdefence.
OL,10,FBoth the teenager and another boy had
OL,11,Fpreviously admitted to separate
OL,12,Fcharges of robbing Mr Erfani and
OL,13,Fpossessing a bladed article.
OL,15,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
