FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785383016
OL,3,CTeenage boy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Cdrug dealer
OL,6,FThe court heard that the two boys did
OL,7,Fnot know Mr Erfani but were aware that
OL,8,Fhe dealt drugs.
OL,10,FThe boys robbed Mr Erfani before the
OL,11,F16-year-old stabbed him in the chest.
OL,13,FDuring the trial, Charles Rowe KC,
OL,14,Fdefending, said that the 16-year-old
OL,15,Fhad acted in self-defence when he
OL,16,Fstabbed Mr Erfani, claiming the man
OL,17,Fhad lunged for the boys after they had
OL,18,Frobbed him.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
