OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785383016
OL,3,CTeenage boy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Cdrug dealer
OL,6,FHowever, prosecutor Anna Vigars KC,
OL,7,Fsaid: "Mr Erfani had no knife on him
OL,8,Fand, other than begging (the boys) not
OL,9,Fto take his mobile, he had offered no
OL,10,Fresistance to the robbery.
OL,12,F"We say that that stabbing was a
OL,13,Fdeliberate act done for no reason that
OL,14,Fanyone could see ` an act of
OL,15,Fbrutality, to reinforce the fact that
OL,16,F(the boy) was not one to be messed
OL,17,Fwith, to ensure that his name was not
OL,18,Freported in connection with the
OL,19,Frobbery that they had just committed."
OL,26,@pD@YpmpD@bpnxD@ApmxD@Ipn
