OL,3,CTeenage boy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Cdrug dealer
OL,6,FBoth boys have been remanded in
OL,7,Fcustody for sentencing at Bristol
OL,8,FCrown Court on Tuesday 8 September.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
